<title>USA: Investor's stake in Ambanc dips below 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Investor's stake in Ambanc dips below 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennsylvania investor Frederick Jaindl said Wednesday his stake in Ambanc Holding Co Inc dipped to 240,800 shares or 4.93 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Jaindl said his latest transactions include the sale of 121,100 common shares on October 7 at prices ranging from $10.50 to $10.5625 per share.</p>
